{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1932","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Moving Platforms"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There is a game where you need to move through a labyrinth. The labyrinth consists of $$$n$$$ platforms, connected by $$$m$$$ passages. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each platform is at some level $$$l_i$$$, an integer number from $$$0$$$ to $$$H - 1$$$. In a single step, if you are currently on platform $$$i$$$, you can stay on it, or move to another platform $$$j$$$. To move to platform $$$j$$$ they have to be connected by the passage, and their levels have to be the same, namely $$$l_i = l_j$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each step, the levels of all platforms change. The new level of platform $$$i$$$ is calculated as $$$l'_i = (l_i + s_i) \\bmod H$$$, for all $$$i$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You start on platform $$$1$$$. Find the minimum number of steps you need to get to platform $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases. Then the descriptions of the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$H$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\le m \\le 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\le H \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$l_i$$$, the initial level of each platform ($$$0 \\le l_i \\le H-1$$$). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$s_i$$$, the change of level for each platform ($$$0 \\le s_i \\le H-1$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next $$$m$$$ lines contain a description of the passages. Each passage is described as a pair of integers — the platforms, connected by the passage. There is at most one passage connecting each pair of platforms, and there is no passage connecting a platform to itself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$n$$$ for all tests does not exceed $$$10^5$$$, the sum of $$$m$$$ for all tests does not exceed $$$10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print a single integer, the minimum number of steps needed to get from platform $$$1$$$ to platform $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is impossible to get to platform $$$n$$$, print $$$-1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3 3 10\n1 9 4\n2 3 0\n1 2\n3 2\n1 3\n2 1 10\n1 2\n4 6\n1 2\n8 7 25\n22 14 5 3 10 14 11 1\n9 5 4 10 7 16 18 18\n2 8\n6 3\n3 5\n7 5\n2 6\n1 4\n4 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n-1\n52\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This is how levels of the platforms change, and what actions we need to perform in the first example."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Platform 1"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Platform 2"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Platform 3"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Action"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Step 1"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"9"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Stay on the platform 1"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Step 2"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2"